# Reference images used while building the game. Neither is loaded at
# runtime. The gametiles one is another studio's Play Store artwork and
# does not belong in a public repo; vehicle-reference.jpg is here for the
# same reason — if that photo is yours to publish, delete the line.
#
# assets/radio/ is the exception: the radio plays those files, so they
# have to ship. Everything else under assets/ stays out.
assets/*
!assets/radio/
gametiles_*.jpg
